# e5m4 E1 "e5m4_green" (docs/design/mission-e5-04.md, Cinematic hooks; script-episodes-4-8/e5m4.md 1): 15 s at 0:00, mode=pause
# over the live mission (the spec's HOLD runs as PAUSE). The Proving Green (120 x 120): Malrik's yard north-west
# (-42, -42), Vessa's south-east (42, 42); banners Shadow (-22, -22), West (-28, 20), the Orrery (0, 0), East (28, -20),
# Fire (22, 22); the Orrery Terrace on the cliff north of the field (0, -64), outside the bounds (no actors there yet).
# 1) WIDE from the terrace over the Green, five banners, the long shadows lying north-west: L1; 2) the terrace (the
# Master, Torvald, Ysolde and Vey are not in the mission: the bell frame's view down the field): L2; 3) MS two-shot
# Malrik and Vessa at their starts (orbits the live hero, tag `malrik`; the cast stands at Malrik's start for cine's
# checks). Axis: the Malrik - terrace line north-south; every camera stays on its EAST side.
# Fallback: the end state says L1-L4 and shows the first hint.
cine e5m4_green  title="The Proving Green"  mode=pause  letterbox=2.39  seed=541  length=13..17
env day  moon_yaw=135  moon_pitch=-24  energy=1.0
cast  malrik    res://art/units/wizards/malrik.tscn  at=(-34, 0, -34)  yaw=135
cast  narrator  capsule  at=(0, 0, -300)  hidden=1
cast  master    capsule  at=(0, 0, -310)  hidden=1

# WIDE from the terrace over the Proving Green: five banners, long shadows north-west
shot G1 6.0  cam=crane  from=(8, 30, -66)  to=(10, 24, -58)  look=(0, 0, 0)>(0, 0, 6)  fov=52>48  in=fade_black:0.6
  at 0.0  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/evenmead_amb.wav  vol=-10
  at 0.4  line narrator "Five years later, below the citadel. A friendly match. Supposedly."
# The terrace's view: the bell frame above the field; the Master's rule over it
shot G2 5.0  cam=static  from=(6, 14, -60)  look=(0, 2, -20)  fov=40
  at 0.2  line master "Five banners. The first to hold three while the bell counts thirty wins. Nobody gets hurt."
# MS Malrik at his start, turning to his yard (east of the axis)
shot G3 4.0  cam=orbit  pivot=malrik  r=4.6  h=1.5  deg=20>30
  at 3.4  fade alpha=1 time=0.6